<title>AUSTRIA: TABLE-OMV doubles H1 pre-tax profits.</title>
<headline>TABLE-OMV doubles H1 pre-tax profits.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to June 30</p>
<p>			  (billions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>  Group EBIT		 3.11		   vs 1.51</p>
<p>  Group pre-tax profit   2.93		   vs 1.56</p>
<p>  Group net profit	 1.35		   vs 1.24</p>
<p>  Group sales	     45.31		  vs 37.35</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is OMV AG. The company is an oil and chemicals group and is Austria's biggest industrial concern. Group sales excluded oil tax.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +43 1 53112 258</p>
</text>
